  "description": "Haeru, who has the mysterious ability to predict the future, rejects fate and runs away. One day, the wrong scholar appeared in front of her! A monstrous man who blackmails the best street in the world and insists that the fight is made by the head, not the body. However, the moment she meets him, Hae-ru's stopped fate begins to change again. In the 15th century Joseon, the greatest genius Monarch of Joseon and a mysterious woman bound by the chains of fate, which cannot be recorded in the Annals, are sweet love and war!\n\n[Original Web Novel](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=1776477)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=783536), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8011956)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[S.Chinese](https://www.dongmanmanhua.cn/LOVE/haishideshenlou/list?title_no=2114), [T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/eastern-palace/night-mirage/list?title_no=5006)",
